<o:Entity Id="o297">
<a:ObjectID>BEACB1BA-0C7E-46CD-98C8-9BB18405DCA4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>COMPANY</a:Name>
<a:Code>COMPANY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Name:
Company

Definition:
A COMPANY is a legally constructed organization that is created for the purpose of conducting legitimate business.

Examples:
1) Aera Energy
2) LLC,
3) Schlumberger
4) McJunkin
5) TekSystems
6) SENA
7) SENAC
8) SIEP
9) SCL
10) SOI
11) SWEPI
12) Group Companies


Behavior Rules:
1) A COMPANY is a legal entity registered with a Registrar of Companies.
2) Used in a general sense, may also include unincorporated joint ventures.
3) The smallest Shell organizational unit for which a complete self-contained set of accounts can be drawn up for purposes of external reporting (e.g. Profit/Loss and Balance Sheet reports are generated off the Company Code).

Other Business Names:

Source:
AERA

Change Log:
7/12/2012 - Added additional examples.
</a:Comment>
<a:Annotation>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Segoe UI;}}
