<o:Entity Id="o298">
<a:ObjectID>10AEB82D-5554-44E8-9D01-DC81D9E779AA</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>CONTACT_MECHANISM</a:Name>
<a:Code>CONTACT MECHANISMS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The full specification of a means of contacting something or someone.
Examples are:
A fully-specified street address (i.e. Street Number, Street Name, City, State, &amp; Zip Code),
a fully-specified phone number (e.g. area code, prefix, suffix, &amp; extension),
a fax number, mobile phone number, pager number, email address.
Note:  for our business purposes it has been decided that all contact mechanisms are attributive to the associated entity.  In other words, there is no business need to manage the mechanisms themselves, separately from the entity that they are used to contact.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,251={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
{A5E0A12D-2B90-4F65-8C47-EC4B1C216744},MTED_EDaM_Security_Classification,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
{66B264C2-77DF-4936-90F7-430A96048FC3},MTED_EDaM_Design_Status,5=Draft

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:Entity>
<o:Entity Id="o299">
<a:ObjectID>BFD0CFEB-AE20-4C23-B8DE-7CD890883983</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>CONTACT_MECHANISM_ROLE</a:Name>
<a:Code>CONTACT MECHANISM ROLES</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Identifies the roles the contact mechanism plays.  A particular contact mechanism may play 0, 1 or many roles.
Example:  If Joe has an address of 100 Main Street, that address can play the role of his &#39;shipping address&#39; and his &#39;remit to address&#39;.  He, however, may have a second address, 59 West Street, that plays the role of &#39;correspondence mailing address&#39;.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,251={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
