<o:Entity Id="o29">
<a:ObjectID>23FBA2D1-8C61-4981-8689-E52B480F5819</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>FACILITY</a:Name>
<a:Code>FACILITIES</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A capability to perform a business function or a service.  It is a token or a concept used to describe the functional capability that may arise from the installation of Equipment and Materials.
Facilities do not have mass, they are not physical objects.  Only the Equipment or Materials that are installed to provide the service are physical objects.  The actual equipment or materials that are installed at a Facility can change over time, and can be any type of equipment or materials that carry out the same business function.  Facilities enable business functions to be described independently of the equipment or materials that may be installed from time to time.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,333={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
