<o:Entity Id="o318">
<a:ObjectID>AD163901-1126-4F4F-B475-E08296D2205B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>FACILITY_SPECIFICATION</a:Name>
<a:Code>FACILITY SPECIFICATIONS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The specific value of a PARAMETER TYPE for a particular FACILITY.   For example, the &quot;Capacity&quot; of a Steam Generator might be &quot;3,000&quot; (UNIT OF MEASURE: CWE (cold water equivalent) barrels of steam per day).
This describes a relatively static characteristic of a FACILITY (i.e., the nature of the facility).  The data which describe a FACILITY&#39;s ongoing, dynamic, operational characteristics are contained in DYNAMIC PARAMETER VALUE.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,333={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
