<o:Entity Id="o333">
<a:ObjectID>C2687090-D83C-4916-AA28-0B82902B23F1</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ITEM_SPECIFICATION</a:Name>
<a:Code>ITEM_SPECIFICATION</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The actual VALUE of one Parameter Type (i.e. characteristic) of a specified Item at a specified point in time. For Example: To specify the Parameter &quot;horsepower&quot; of a specific ITEM -- a Gould 3160 Centrigugal Horizontal Overhung Pump, mfr serial number #123456000 -- we would find that given ITEM and the given PARAMETER TYPE (horsepower) associated with an ITEM SPECIFICATION, in which we would find the &quot;Value&quot; of, for example, &quot;45&quot; (hp). Expressed in a sentence: &quot;A 45 [ITEM SPECIFICATION] horsepower [PARAMETER TYPE] Gould 3160 [ITEM, mfr ser #123456000].&quot;</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,251={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
