<a:Name>MANAGEMENT_PLANT</a:Name>
<a:Code>MANAGEMENT PLANTS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1587411946</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>TOOLBUS</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1587501685</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A type of facility that is the highest level facility in the facility structure of the  enterprise.  Management Plants contain all other facilities in the enterprise.  They are used for management purposes of maintenance planning, reporting, etc.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,333={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
