<a:Modifier>Gabriela.Velea</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A grouping of Work Activities and associated information that constitutes a plan for accomplishing a goal. A project consists of Lower Level Work Activities and Work Breakdown Structure (WBS) Elements. A project cannot be nested within another project, projects are grouped via Programmes.

Note:
A project may exist to build a facility or to group activities by the function, or group, responsible for executing the work on an ongoing basis (as in the case of a Completions &amp; Well Intervention Functional Activity Plan for IAP)</a:Comment>
